	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Etiamsi multis plaustris literarum istuc coner, non possim tamen pro dignitate <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quicquam respondere tuis tot amantissimis ac christianissimis literis, ut <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>multo satius existimem agendarum referendarumque gratiarum officium <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>in unum deum optimum maximum, omnium bonorum autorem simul reiicere <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quam me etiam supra vires conando prorsum succumbere nec quicquam tamen efficere.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Sic autem habe me cunctum cum meis omnibus ita tibi velut ab integro <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>obstrictos esse ut nemini mortalium magis compellareque nos perpetuis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>votis cęli terręque dominum, ut te cum tuis sub alarum suarum tutissima custo<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>dia ęternum tueatur, angelum percutientem a tuis ędibus quam longissi<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>me abarceat cęlesti benedictione imbutos ac confirmatos <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>usque conservet.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Aedes nostrę iam a filioli morte repurgatiores videntur <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ab exitiali ista lue, quam tamen lubenter domini manum agnoscimus <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>et adorabundi merito exosculamur scientes unius ipsius nutu <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>vel stare nos vel cadere, staturos autem, quod potens ille sit statu<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ere nos, cuius etiam ea est irę brevitas et favoris longinquitas, ut, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>etiamsi vespere fletus incumbat, ut vates noster ait, mane tamen rursus <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>exoriatur lęticia, ut recte nos illi, quantulicunque sumus, permittamus, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>qui occidit moxque in vitam revocat, demittit in Orcum et extrahit, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>de cuius erga nos inęstimabili favore nihil prorsum est quod dubitam<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>us, tot nimirum claris argumentis edocti, tot egregiis pignoribus <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>confirmati, ut, si millies moriendum sit, leve merito videri <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>debeat, quandoquidem misericordia ipsius, quod idem propheta <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>cecinit, vel ipsa vita suavior est, quum praesertim quaelibet, quamlibet <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>iucunda videri possit, vita extra illius favorem ipsissimo mors sit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Gratias ago deo meo per Iesum Christum, qui unus nobis vita est et resur<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>rectio, sapientia, iusticia, sanctificatio, redemptio et nihil non a deo factus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>est, in quo viventem me ac morientem vera solidaque fide inveniri <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>et cupio et totis animis spero.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Is te, mi anime, mi charissime et optime <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>frater, cum domestica ecclesia tua fide subinde augescentem fove<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>at et conservet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salveant omnes administri tui in opere domini cum cęteris <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>amicis et fratribus unaque tecum pro meisque serio seduloque <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>apud gratię thronum vota faciant, ut in finem usque fortiter duremus.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Salvere te cum tuis iubet charissima mea coniunx, quam diligenter domino commendato.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l555">Vitoduri</placeName> 19. februarii 1551.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius Blaurerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>De <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgensibus</placeName> malo <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>nihil quam incerta ad te scribere; <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>constanter affirmant illorum res prorsum salvas esse <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>nec unquam illos commissuros, ut in pacis conditiones <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>se indignas consentiant, citius rem et vitam et omnia perdituros<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Der premisch hauff soll gar zerflogen und zerstoben sin, <foreign xml:lang="la">quamquam alii contra affirmant.</foreign></s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Dem churfursten von <placeName ref="l749">Sachsen</placeName> ist aber ain truwer alter diener von seiner <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>spanyscher guardi erstochen worden; aber nieman wills thon haben.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Der konig verruckt von <placeName ref="l18">Augspurg</placeName> noch dis wochen, wie man schribt.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Der kaiser soll verziechen byß calendas maij, da das concilium angedt, und <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>alsdann uff das <placeName>Niderland</placeName> verrucken.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Mitt dem <placeName ref="l2510">Turcken</placeName> bestadts fuͤr und fuͤr, das er in rustung seye.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/>Abbt von <placeName ref="l1294">Wingarten</placeName> soll zuͦ <placeName ref="l409">Ravenspurg</placeName>, <placeName ref="l234">Ysne</placeName>, <placeName ref="l907">Kempten</placeName>, <placeName ref="l45">Bi[berach]</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>und vyllicht ouch <placeName ref="l291">Lyndauw</placeName> die oberkaiten enderen in kai[serlicher] m[ajesta]t namen; <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>dann man kendt nunmehr die leut, wer yederman ist.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Es schic[kt] <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>sich alles, das <placeName ref="l822">Germanien</placeName> ain aigen, verkoufft volck und in herter <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>dienstbarkait gequelt werd; sy will Christi nitt, so hab sy die antichristen <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>wie die Juden iren <persName>Titus</persName> und <persName>Vespasianum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">O herr gott, erbarm dich dis j[amers]!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">D. Bullingero</persName> suo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
